+This category licenses an inference between environments. An analyst who
+has established the grammatical assignment of reaction \mention{ouch}
+from independent uses can expect it also to supplement an intact
+clause. From an identified supplementary \mention{oops}, the analyst can
+expect an independent utterance without recovering a missing predicate.
+The grammatical descriptions warrant these expectations about the core;
+the pairs in (\ref{ex:core-distribution}) illustrate their application.
